[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-005-cqrs-pattern.md#read-your-writes-consistency]

#### Read-Your-Writes Consistency

**Use when**: User must immediately see their own changes

**Implementation strategies**:

1. **Return projection from command**:
```csharp
public async Task<ProviderRemittanceDto> ProcessClaim(ProcessClaimCommand cmd)
{
    var result = await commandHandler.Handle(cmd);
    var projection = await BuildProjection(result); // Synchronous projection
    return projection;
}
```

2. **Versioned reads with retry**:
```csharp
// Command returns version/timestamp
var response = await commandApi.ProcessClaim(cmd); // Returns version: 42

// Query with version requirement
var view = await queryApi.GetRemittance(providerId, minVersion: 42); // Waits until version ≥ 42
```

3. **Session-based consistency**:
```csharp
// Store write version in session/cookie
Response.Cookies.Append("LastWriteVersion", writeVersion);

// Query checks session version
var sessionVersion = Request.Cookies["LastWriteVersion"];
var view = await queryApi.GetRemittance(providerId, sessionVersion);
```

