[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-005-cqrs-pattern.md#strong-consistency]

#### Strong Consistency

**Use when**: Business rules require immediate consistency (rare in CQRS)

**Implementation**:
- Synchronous projection updates within same transaction
- Blocks command response until read model updated
- Defeats main CQRS benefits (independent scaling, performance)

**Use cases**:
- Regulatory requirements (e.g., account balance before withdrawal)
- Inventory management (prevent overselling)
- Seat reservations (prevent double-booking)

**Example**:
```csharp
using var transaction = await dbContext.Database.BeginTransactionAsync();
try
{
    // Update write model
    await commandHandler.Handle(cmd);

    // Update read model synchronously
    await projectionService.UpdateReadModel(cmd);

    await transaction.CommitAsync();
    return Ok();
}
catch
{
    await transaction.RollbackAsync();
    throw;
}
```

