[patterns/application/api-microservices/PTN-APP-API-005-cqrs-pattern.md#1-synchronous-projections]

#### 1. Synchronous Projections

**Problem**: Updating read models synchronously defeats CQRS benefits

```csharp
// ❌ BAD: Synchronous projection
public async Task<IActionResult> ProcessClaim(ProcessClaimCommand cmd)
{
    await commandHandler.Handle(cmd);
    await projectionService.UpdateAllReadModels(cmd); // Blocks response
    return Ok();
}
```

**Solution**: Asynchronous event-driven projections

```csharp
// ✅ GOOD: Asynchronous projection
public async Task<IActionResult> ProcessClaim(ProcessClaimCommand cmd)
{
    var commandId = await commandHandler.Handle(cmd);
    // Events published asynchronously, projections update in background
    return Accepted(new { commandId }); // Return immediately
}
```

